==Project Details==
*'''Operator: '''Southern Natural Gas Co
*'''Owner:''' Kinder Morgan Energy Partners (50%), Southern Company (50%)<ref name=":1">{{Cite web|url=https://www.southerncompany.com/content/dam/southerncompany/pdfs/news/sng-factsheet-090116.pdf|title=Southern Company, Kinder Morgan enter Southern Natural Gas strategic venture|last=|first=|date=|website=Southern Company|url-status=live|archive-url=|archive-date=|access-date=30 August, 2023}}</ref>
*'''Parent Company: '''Kinder Morgan Energy Partners (50%), Southern Company (50%)<ref name=":1" />
*'''Current capacity:''' 3900 Million cubic feet per day
*'''Proposed capacity:'''  
*'''Length: ''' 7,600 miles /  12,231 km<ref name=":0" />
*'''Status: '''Operating
*'''Start Year: '''1928

==Background==
The Southern Natural Gas Pipeline system is operated by Kinder Morgan Energy Partners, and owned by Kinder Morgan (50%) and Southern Company (50%).<ref name=":0" />

